      "content": "Magnesium citrate is a great choice, and 600-800mg is a reasonable dose. The recommended daily intake is around 400-420mg, but some people may need more, especially if they're not getting enough from their diet. Taking 600-800mg before bed is a good way to help with relaxation and cramp relief. Just make sure to drink plenty of water throughout the day to help your body absorb it.",
