      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i actually have some kidney issues too, my doctor said my kidney function is a bit low (stage 3 chronic kidney disease) so i've been a bit worried about supplements. does the kidney thing change anything or should i still go ahead with the 800mg? i really need the sleep lol",
